TITLE 1D cation exchange transport
SOLUTION 0
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
SOLUTION 1-10
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X- 0.001
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -print_cells 1-10
    -print_frequency 1
PRINT
    -exchange true
END